## 3. DB 모델

### EmailInboxConfig (유저별 이메일 설정)

```python
class EmailInboxConfig(IntPKMixin, TimestampMixin, Base):
    __tablename__ = "email_inbox_configs"
    __table_args__ = (UniqueConstraint("owner_user_id"),)

    organization_id: int  # FK → organizations.id
    owner_user_id: int    # FK → users.id (1:1)
    imap_host: str        # 예: imap.gmail.com
    imap_port: int        # 기본 993
    imap_use_ssl: bool    # 기본 True
    email_address: str    # 로그인 이메일
    email_password: str   # 앱 비밀번호 (암호화 저장)
    subject_keyword: str  # 매칭할 Subject 키워드 (예: "[가계부]")
    default_wallet_id: int | None  # FK → accounts.id (기본 결제수단)
    poll_interval_minutes: int  # 기본 5
    is_active: bool       # 활성화 여부
    last_checked_at: datetime | None  # 마지막 확인 시각
    last_uid: str | None  # 마지막 처리한 이메일 UID
```

### EmailImportLog (처리 이력)

```python
class EmailImportLog(IntPKMixin, TimestampMixin, Base):
    __tablename__ = "email_import_logs"

    config_id: int       # FK → email_inbox_configs.id
    email_uid: str       # IMAP UID
    email_subject: str
    email_date: datetime
    status: str          # "SUCCESS" | "PARSE_ERROR" | "REGISTER_ERROR" | "SKIPPED"
    transaction_id: int | None  # FK → transactions.id (성공 시)
    error_message: str | None
```

